{"Title":"An Act authorizing the Cotuit Fire District to raise and appropriate money for the Historical Society of Santuit and Cotuit","BillNumber":"H5090","DocketNumber":"HD5433","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"KAD1","Name":"Kip A. Diggs","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KAD1","ResponseDate":"2024-08-20T16:01:23.873"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"KAD1","Name":"Kip A. Diggs","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KAD1","ResponseDate":"2024-08-20T16:01:23.8733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5090/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Diggs of Barnstable, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Kip A. Diggs relative to authorizing the Cotuit Fire District to raise and appropriate money for the Historical Society of Santuit and Cotuit.  Municipalities and Regional Government.","DocumentText":"\tChapter  328 of the acts of 1926, as most recently amended by chapter 26 of the acts of 2000, is hereby further amended by inserting after section 2 the following section:-\r\n\tSection 2A. The district may raise, appropriate and transfer funds to The Historical Society of Santuit and Cotuit, Inc.  in the city known as the town of Barnstable to provide for its operational needs and programming and preservation services.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52"